002E 2000 
0030 0603    53         DEC  R3                COUNT IT
0032 1307    54         JEQ  XF2               0, DONE
0034 05C2    55         INCT R2                UPDATE INDEX
0036 0282    56         CI   R2,>1000          OFF PAGE?
0038 1000 
003A 1AF8    57         JL   XF1               N, LOOP
003C 04C2    58         CLR  R2                Y, RESET IT
003E 0592    59         INC  *R2               GET NEXT PAGE
0040 10F5    60         JMP  XF1               LOOP
